  <h2 id="next-step">Your next step</h2>
  <p class="line">
    A career change after 5 years in India works best as a decision you build evidence for, not a decision you talk yourself into overnight. Run the skills transfer audit this week. Start the runway conversation with your household this month. Check real job postings before you tell anyone you have decided. If you want a second, structured opinion instead of working through all three alone, <a href={guidanceUrl}>career counselling and guidance</a> is built for exactly this kind of decision-pressure moment, and a <a href={assessmentsUrl}>free career and skill assessment</a> is a reasonable first, no-cost check on fit before you commit further time or money.
  </p>

